---
description: Always load the specification manifest and the global invariants
alwaysApply: true
---

The version-controlled specification corpus is the primary product. The
implementation is an expression of that corpus.

Load these two before any change, every time:

- [spec/README.md](mdc:spec/README.md) - authority model, precedence, document
  ownership, and the routing table from a touched path to the specifications
  that govern it.
- [spec/invariants.md](mdc:spec/invariants.md) - the global invariants. Cite
  them by ID; do not restate them.

Load nothing else from `spec/` speculatively. The other rules in this directory
fire on the paths you touch. [CLAUDE.md](mdc:CLAUDE.md) is the single source of
truth for how to work here.

When a specification and the code disagree, report the conflict. Do not quietly
change either side to match the other.
